+# 1=router-host.
+seed 3003
+run 15000ms
+era 3
+fixture qos
+expect hash stable
+at 100ms draw 0 1 standard
+at 100ms draw 1 2 standard
+at 100ms draw 3 1 standard
+at 100ms draw 4 1 standard
+at 3000ms lane 1 streaming express
+at 3000ms lane 1 email best_effort
+at 3000ms weights 1 50 30 20
+capture at 1000ms
+capture at 6000ms
